                ],
                "steps": [
                    {
                        "step": "To prepare a 100 mg/ml stock solution, dissolve 100 mg of 1-Naphthylacetic Acid (NAA) in a few millilitres of 1 M NaOH, then fill up to 100 ml with absolute ethanol."
